<title>CANADA: GM Canada sales rise 20.7 pct in December.</title>
<headline>GM Canada sales rise 20.7 pct in December.</headline>
<dateline>OSHAWA, Ontario 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors of Canada Ltd, a wholly owned unit of General Motors Corp, said on Monday its sales for December were as follows:</p>
<p>		     PCT CHANGE	    1996	     1995</p>
<p>   Total	   +20.7		   29,432	   24,380</p>
<p>   Cars	    +12.6		   14,296	   12,695</p>
<p>   Trucks	  +29.5		   15,136	   11,685</p>
<p>   YEAR-TO-DATE  PCT CHANGE	    1996	     1995</p>
<p>   Total	   -1.1		   380,223	  384,270</p>
<p>   Cars	    -5.1		   216,366	  227,944</p>
<p>   Trucks	  +4.8		   163,857	  156,326</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
